#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:5 0b693c559c28442a84d1ad9e9f18750b
#: 3a163309181a4024a1bb803568d169e1 c04b31e54f2e4d528d63db8069da21be
#: c72af9f65ebb4b34adf9994dbecd5917 f5c8498a182b46d9b5747704229409d9
msgid "Independent Watchdog and Crash Dump"
msgstr "独立看门狗与崩溃转储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:7 4a2459cc3bce4215a0739829e6374fdd
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot 4.0 and later firmware revisions, the autopilot cpu's internal "
"independent watchdog has been enabled. It can be disabled (NOT recommended!)"
" by setting :ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0. The cpu will be reset if a "
"peripheral or code takes too long to complete its scheduled software thread "
"or \"hangs\" the cpu, and will restart the cpu. This may or may not save the"
" vehicle if in flight or motion."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本固件中，飞控 CPU 的内部独立看门狗已启用。可通过设置 "
":ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0 "
"将其禁用（不推荐！）。如果某个外设或代码执行其计划软件线程时耗时过长或「卡住」CPU，CPU "
"将会复位并重启。这在飞行或运动中可能会也可能不会挽救飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:9 49350cc4dcba474f9560018d7a86ee45
msgid ""
"In the case of a \"HARD FAULT\" (illegal instruction, out of bounds memory "
"access,etc.) instead of a delay in completing a thread in timely manner, "
"before resetting, the code will attempt to write a file called "
"crash_dump.bin in the flash capturing the cpu state and registers for later "
"analysis (See section below for more details). A \"HARD FAULT\" is extremely"
" serious and should be reported to ArduPilot. The vehicle is probably not "
"safe to fly until the cause is resolved."
msgstr ""
"发生「硬件故障」（非法指令、内存越界访问等）时，而非线程超时延迟，代码在复位前将尝试在闪存中写入名为 crash_dump.bin 的文件，记录 CPU"
" 状态和寄存器以供后续分析（详见下节）。「硬件故障」极为严重，应向 ArduPilot 报告。在查明原因之前，该飞行器可能不安全飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:38 24fae813f05742e09e075774987af8a5
#: 8ba01cd7961442298a018d451aad6c62 b4a92bf6512845cab75a0e482bfa19df
#: c500632d96364f399d9780854d1e0a2c d65a73244c2743a089e9f8437ca4bede
msgid "Determining that a Watchdog Reset Occurred"
msgstr "判断是否发生了看门狗复位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:40 9b73aa6762dd4862b337914ef85679d3
#: 9e482548bd9942a09f5c64f46e5b75d4 b7b1bdeff9ce4c6c8342abdaa3befd0e
#: d16ed4103a5c45fab65ad6a5082b9eff f8bcd429c66043219427db77699ef03b
msgid ""
"One way is by looking at the dataflash logs. If the log is filtered to show "
"only the \"MSG\" messages it can be seen that some include the word, "
"\"watchdog\". This is a clear indication that the previous log or flight "
"ended with a watchdog reset."
msgstr ""
"一种方法是查看 DataFlash "
"日志。如果过滤日志只显示「MSG」消息，可以看到部分消息包含「watchdog」字样，这清楚表明上一次日志或飞行以看门狗复位结束。"

