msgstr "ICSR：中断控制和状态寄存器（参见 ST 数据手册中的「ICSR 位分配」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:53 999efa383b254c48b774ad4750ed1439
msgid "CRASH DUMP"
msgstr "崩溃转储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:55 76c3d520f6914e7ca4701e968847fd56
msgid ""
"On a \"HARD FAULT\", a file will be attempted to be written to the \"@SYS\" "
"flash area as \"crash_dump.bin\" containing needed system state information "
"for later diagnosis. This file can be downloaded using Misssion Planner or "
"other GCS for forwarding to ArduPilot, either by `forum "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ or :ref:`Discord <ardupilot-discord-"
"server>` post."
msgstr ""
"发生「硬件故障」时，代码将尝试在「@SYS」闪存区域写入名为「crash_dump.bin」的文件，包含后续诊断所需的系统状态信息。该文件可通过 "
"Mission Planner 或其他地面站下载，通过 `论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ 或 "
":ref:`Discord <ardupilot-discord-server>` 发帖转交给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:60 5bdb7a7caa064f2ebebbc6a3d517fcfd
msgid ""
"In addition to the crash_dump.bin file, the preceding dataflash log or the "
"git-hash of the firmware that caused the crash dump should be included in "
"the post of the file."
msgstr "除 crash_dump.bin 文件外，发帖时还应附上崩溃前的 DataFlash 日志或导致崩溃的固件的 git-hash。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:65 995037cf9d86494fbcb8f5911e789918
msgid ""
"As of version 4.5.1, if a crash_dump.bin file has been created, a pre-arm "
"failure will be activated to warn the user of the crash dump so that it may "
"be reported. The pre-arm may be cleared by either re-flashing firmware to "
"the autopilot or by setting the :ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` "
"param to 1 (not recommended)."
msgstr ""
"自 4.5.1 版本起，如已创建 crash_dump.bin 文件，将触发解锁前失败告警以提醒用户报告崩溃转储。可通过重新烧录固件或将 "
":ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` 参数设置为 1（不推荐）来清除该解锁前检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:7 364c088d64d4455f9c25a1139dc9a187
#: 526c49170bb64fa4aaeb75e8d1d7fa61 790282696921450290a1c0c1989839da
#: e024c01c08d745a785dfb1d7e3052e38
msgid ""
"ArduPilot enables the autopilot CPU's internal independent watchdog which "
"causes the CPU to be reset and restarted if a peripheral or some piece of "
"code takes too long to complete or \"hangs\" the CPU.  This may or may not "
"save the vehicle if in flight or motion."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 会启用飞控 CPU 内部的独立看门狗：当某个外设或某段代码执行时间过长或\"挂起\" CPU 时，看门狗会复位并重启 "
"CPU。若发生在飞行或运动中，这不一定能挽救载具。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:9 0df9c155b0154e32b55d5294af6aca0f
#: 435343bf55124919aecaf240fd7f8b57 76c0780796b945cea5ba9d6398b81725
#: d428f688a9ff48e3bca1c6a4f7b3d6a8
msgid ""
"While not recommended, this feature can be disabled by setting "
":ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0."
msgstr "虽然不建议这样做，但可通过设置 :ref:`BRD_OPTIONS<BRD_OPTIONS>` = 0 来禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:11 30c612c17a364ccd8db22e2d87a8dde3
#: 745b427569c0420eb35140c969dd7f98 7a98af730ab140b19b01d71bf968fe18
#: 994c25a7f9f149ea9a99152ae849bf03
msgid ""
"In the case of a \"HARD FAULT\" (e.g an illegal instruction, out of bounds "
"memory access, etc.) before resetting, the watchdog handler code will log a "
"\"WDG\" message to the onboard log, send a \"WDG\" text message to the GCS "
"and attempt to write a crash_dump.bin file to the \"@SYS\" flash area.  This"
" crash_dump.bin file contains the cpu state and registers for later analysis"
" (See section below for more details). A \"HARD FAULT\" is extremely serious"
" and should be reported to ArduPilot. The vehicle is probably not safe to "
"fly until the cause is resolved."
msgstr ""
"在发生 \"HARD FAULT\"（硬件错误，例如非法指令、越界内存访问等）时，看门狗处理代码会在复位前向机载日志记录一条 \"WDG\" 消息，向 "
"GCS 发送一条 \"WDG\" 文本消息，并尝试在 \"@SYS\" 闪存区写入 crash_dump.bin 文件。该 crash_dump.bin"
" 文件包含 CPU 状态和寄存器，供后续分析（详见下文章节）。\"HARD FAULT\" 极其严重，应报告给 "
"ArduPilot。在原因排除之前，载具很可能不适合飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:13 0208c65b49fc453dac2fcdb73fc69e46
#: 884ab6a0dd874fbea0d5bfef6666e8be a7e82ba8caa8432988685a1ab6a183d5
#: d96706945f2c4f4083ee090166e752b2
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot-4.5.1 (and higher), if a crash_dump.bin file has been created, "
"a pre-arm failure will warn the user and prevent arming.  The crash_dump.bin"
" file can be erased by re-flashing the ArduPilot firmware to the autopilot "
"or it can be ignored by setting the "
":ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` param to 1 (not recommended)."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot-4.5.1（及更高版本）中，如果已生成 crash_dump.bin "
"文件，解锁前检查将失败以警告用户并阻止解锁。可通过向飞控重新刷写 ArduPilot 固件来清除 crash_dump.bin 文件，或将 "
":ref:`ARMING_CRSDP_IGN<ARMING_CRSDP_IGN>` 参数设为 1 来忽略它（不推荐）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:20 0cbf5721b24a4f7d9a09d6c67149d997
#: 55455b79b5eb4c8d98b931626ae8a4ba aaf94cc7d002424eae30414645ab1041
#: cb83be3f357644b1bea75af9bf7cc640
msgid "Reporting a Watchdog / Crash Dump"
msgstr "报告看门狗 / 崩溃转储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:22 1ae4231da37a4db1b2a88ad63b50f9af
#: 468ff3c60f4248b2a9742c1f35b82d76 a1e5b073443a4bb2abe0ae78de71cd20
#: de3dfc64c98d47e78b397b21c58e6d9f
msgid ""
"Use Mission Planner or another GCS to download the crash_dump.bin file from "
"the \"@SYS\" flash area."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 或其他 GCS 从 \"@SYS\" 闪存区下载 crash_dump.bin 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:27 656e5b2dc72c4ebfa6f59568832889d7
#: 905de42dc6804316a907070e1bd2d8cd 9cdefeac860543159a8b5554a9691bac
#: d2806783626b47d6b24b22504f239399
msgid ""
"Download the dataflash log from the flight or operation that caused the "
"crash dump to be created.  Information on downloading logs can be found "
":ref:`here <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"下载导致生成崩溃转储的那次飞行或操作的 dataflash 日志。日志下载方法见 :ref:`此处 <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:29 0286913750da43fe92b151faa06e6cd2
#: 081e55027afe439fa999a965ca02a9fb b3e563201f3046f89aac15772ea5891c
#: c3b1bdf8dc444710af3cbc4b3923b374
msgid ""
"If the dataflash log cannot be found, find the git-hash of the firmware.  "
"This appears in the GCS's messages tab soon after startup."
msgstr "如果找不到 dataflash 日志，请查找固件的 git-hash。它会在启动后不久出现在 GCS 的消息（messages）选项卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-watchdog.rst:34 55d10cf9b8b44897b985106950c66cb7
#: 837dc094da1b442b8542be488cce88ae a2c8b368a86749f78e647cb08d9e7600
#: fb6ddbf15b674eccad2c6455bf44dabd
msgid ""
"Open `ArduPilot's support forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__, find "
"the category for your vehicle and software version (e.g. `Copter-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/copter-46/179>`__, `Plane-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arduplane/plane-4-6/182>`__, `Rover-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/ardurover/rover-46/180>`__), create a \"New"
" Topic\", include \"watchdog\" in the title and attach the crash_dump.bin "
"file, log file and/or git-hash as described above.  If the files cannot be "
"uploaded directly, please include a link to where they can be downloaded "
"from."
msgstr ""
"打开 `ArduPilot 支持论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__，找到对应你的载具和软件版本的分类（例如 "
"`Copter-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/copter-46/179>`__、`Plane-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arduplane/plane-4-6/182>`__、`Rover-4.6 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/ardurover/rover-46/180>`__），创建一个 \"New "
"Topic\"，标题中包含 \"watchdog\"，并按上文所述附上 crash_dump.bin 文件、日志文件和/或 git-"
"hash。如果文件无法直接上传，请附上可供下载的链接。"
